y call wab x 106 p2
z call wamem y 54 ps p2
z1 call wab z 5 p2
z2 call waci z1 0 p2
z3 call wab2 z2 11 11 p2
ret z3
end
fn wkhwr (io,u32,u32,u32) u32 u32 bool -> (io,u32,u32,u32)
i2 add p1 2
out mul i2 4
oc4 mul p2 4
nout add out oc4
